      "(12) Nobody Likes Me",
      "",
      "Cola wasn’t in the store.",
      "",
      "“Where’s Cola?” Qian Duoduo asked.",
      "",
      "“Cola … Sorry, Cola isn’t here anymore,” Little Liang said.",
      "",
      "“What? What do you mean ‘isn’t here anymore’? Then where is Cola?” Qian Duoduo wanted to cry.",
      "",
      "“Cola has an owner now. The owner took her home. I’m sorry,” Little Liang said.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo cried and said, “Cola is gone! Nobody likes me! Even you guys don’t like me!!”",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo cried. Little Liang didn’t say anything. He drank alcohol together with Qian Duoduo.",
      "",
      "There were a lot of dogs in the store. They all played together with Qian Duoduo.",
      "Qian Duoduo felt a bit better, but there was no Cola. She really missed Cola …",
      "",
      "At 10 o’clock in the evening, Qian Duoduo returned home."
